cases=[({'declared':['b','a','a','skip'],'saved':{'a':{'kind':'file','hash':'1','meta':{'x':1}},'b':{'kind':'missing'},'skip':{'kind':'file','hash':'old'},'irrelevant':1},'current':{'a':{'meta':{'x':2},'hash':'1','kind':'file'},'skip':{'kind':'file','hash':'new'},'irrelevant':2}}, {'needs_review':True,'changed':['a']}),({'declared':['x'],'saved':{},'current':{}},{'needs_review':False,'changed':[]}),({'declared':['x'],'saved':{},'current':{'x':{'kind':'missing'}}},{'needs_review':False,'changed':[]}),({'declared':['x'],'saved':{'x':{'kind':'file','hash':'h','name':'old','timestamp':1}},'current':{'x':{'timestamp':2,'name':'new','hash':'h','kind':'file'}}},{'needs_review':True,'changed':['x']})]
for request,expected in cases:
 rb,pb=copy.deepcopy(request),copy.deepcopy(p)
 actual=work.evaluate(request,p)
 assert actual==expected,(actual,expected)
 assert request==rb and p==pb
 assert set(actual)=={'needs_review','changed'}
